# Cross repo pins. One git dependency per line, the repository then the exact commit it resolves to.
# qtv-crypto is the signing edge, so it is anchored to an immutable commit, the same rev QCore.rs
# pins, rather than the movable v0.3.0 tag. The shared Quantova-Chain crates qtv-account and qtv-tx
# and the QVM now pin this same rev as well, so the whole tree resolves qtv-crypto to one commit.
